Avoid waiting for the GPU publisher mutex on the host presentation thread.
Retain the immutable acquired reading slot while publication is busy; preserve fences,
newest-completed selection and blank frames. Reset the host snapshot at lifecycle boundaries.
Production-code contention test: reference blocked for 2.007 s; candidate returned promptly.
This fixes one CPU lock stall, not all input latency or GPU saturation. No player flags.
Gameplay comparison and limitations: docs/research/shared-present-input-2026-11-03.md.

